-  * Additional ports configuration
-- * gpuModels
-  * list
-  * ["TYPE_GPU_USED"]
-  * Type of gpu used
-- * image
-  * object
-  * {"command":["vllm","serve","/data/","--served-model-name","opt-125m","--host","0.0.0.0","--port","8000"],"repository":"vllm/vllm-openai","tag":"latest"}
-  * Image configuration
-- * image.command
-  * list
