-  * string
-  * "latest"
-  * Image tag
-- * livenessProbe
-  * object
-  * {"failureThreshold":3,"httpGet":{"path":"/health","port":8000},"initialDelaySeconds":15,"periodSeconds":10}
-  * Liveness probe configuration
